	(text "Chain: J1 -> D1 bottom right -> D2 top right -> D3 top left -> D4 bottom left (as the firmware expects).\nThe level shifter and the 330 ohm series resistor are on the hub; brightness is capped in firmware (45 %).\nBoard outline from the CAD: a thin frame around the key collar, LEDs at today's carrier positions."
